const state={filter:{toko:'Semua',restaurant:'Semua'},search:{toko:'',restaurant:''},cart:load('cart',{toko:{},restaurant:{}}),drawer:null,modal:null,mobileMenu:false,laundryPlan:'reguler',weight:3,activityTab:'all'};
const setCart=()=>save('cart',state.cart);
function current(){let hash=location.hash.startsWith('#')?location.hash.slice(1):'/';return hash.split('?')[0]||'/'}
function query(){const p=(location.hash.split('?')[1]||'');return new URLSearchParams(p)}
function statusPill(s){const k=s==='Selesai'?'done':s==='Diproses'?'process':'demo';return `<span class="status-pill status-pill--${k}">${esc(s||'Demo tersimpan')}</span>`}
function brand(){return `<a class="brand" href="#/" aria-label="ARJUNA KOST PAKAM, kembali ke beranda"><span class="brand-icon">${mark()}</span><span class="brand-type"><strong>ARJUNA</strong><small>KOST PAKAM</small></span></a>`}
function header(){const p=current();return `<header class="site-header"><div class="container header-inner">${brand()}<nav class="header-links" aria-label="Navigasi utama"><a href="#/" ${p==='/'?'aria-current="page"':''}>Beranda</a><details class="nav-dropdown"><summary>Layanan ${icon('chevronDown')}</summary><div class="nav-panel">${services.map(s=>`<a href="#${s.path}">${icon(s.ico)}<span>${esc(s.name)}</span>${icon('chevron')}</a>`).join('')}</div></details><a href="#/aktivitas" ${p==='/aktivitas'?'aria-current="page"':''}>Aktivitas</a><a href="#/bantuan" ${p==='/bantuan'?'aria-current="page"':''}>Bantuan</a></nav><div class="header-actions"><span class="header-availability"><span class="status-dot"></span> PAKAM, DELI SERDANG</span><a class="btn btn-outline btn-small" href="#/bantuan">${icon('message')} Hubungi Kami</a><button type="button" class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="${state.mobileMenu?'Tutup':'Buka'} menu navigasi" aria-expanded="${state.mobileMenu}" data-action="mobile-menu">${icon(state.mobileMenu?'close':'menu')}</button></div></div>${state.mobileMenu?`<nav class="mobile-menu" aria-label="Menu seluler">${[...services,{path:'/aktivitas',name:'Aktivitas',ico:'clock'},{path:'/admin-demo',name:'Panel Demo',ico:'bars'}].map(s=>`<a href="#${s.path}">${icon(s.ico)} ${esc(s.name)}</a>`).join('')}</nav>`:''}</header>`}
function mobileTabs(){const p=current();if(p==='/')return '';return `<nav class="mobile-tabs" aria-label="Navigasi cepat"><a href="#/" ${p==='/'?'aria-current="page"':''}>${icon('home')}<span>Beranda</span></a><a href="#/toko" ${['/toko','/restaurant','/laundry'].includes(p)?'aria-current="page"':''}>${icon('shop')}<span>Layanan</span></a><a href="#/aktivitas" ${p==='/aktivitas'?'aria-current="page"':''}>${icon('receipt')}<span>Aktivitas</span></a><a href="#/bantuan" ${p==='/bantuan'?'aria-current="page"':''}>${icon('support')}<span>Bantuan</span></a></nav>`}
function footer(){return `<footer class="site-footer"><div class="container"><div class="footer-top"><div class="footer-brand">${brand()}<p>Satu tempat untuk kebutuhan tinggal dan aktivitas harian. Lebih dekat, lebih praktis, dengan bantuan yang jelas saat dibutuhkan.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><div><h4>Jelajahi</h4><a href="#/kost">Kost Arjuna</a><a href="#/toko">Toko Arjuna</a><a href="#/laundry">Laundry Arjuna</a></div><div><h4>Lainnya</h4><a href="#/restaurant">Restaurant Arjuna</a><a href="#/bantuan">Customer Service</a><a href="#/aktivitas">Aktivitas Demo</a><a href="#/admin-demo">Panel Demo</a></div></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© ${new Date().getFullYear()} ARJUNA KOST PAKAM · Pakam, Deli Serdang</span><span class="footer-note">Versi prototipe • Harga, foto dan formulir masih simulasi. Belum menerima pesanan nyata.</span></div></div></footer>`}
function crumbs(last){return `<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Jejak halaman"><a href="#/">${icon('home')} Beranda</a>${icon('chevron')}<span aria-current="page">${esc(last)}</span></nav>`}
function badgeNote(){return `<span class="preview-ribbon">${icon('info')} Demo interaktif · Belum menerima transaksi nyata</span>`}
function hero({title,accent,desc,img,kicker,theme=''} ){return `<section class="page-hero ${theme}"><div class="page-hero-text"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span>${esc(kicker)}</span><h1>${title} <em>${accent}</em></h1><p>${esc(desc)}</p><div class="mini-points"><span>${icon('checkCircle')} Mudah digunakan</span><span>${icon('shield')} Bantuan jelas</span></div></div><div class="page-hero-image"><img src="assets/${img}" alt="Foto konsep ${esc(kicker)} (ilustrasi, bukan foto operasional asli)" /></div></section>`}
function home(){return `<section class="home-shell"><div class="container"><div class="home-hero"><div class="hero-flourish left">${icon('sparkles')} good people,<br/> better days</div><div class="hero-flourish right">your place,<br/> your pace ${icon('heart')}</div><span class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> YOUR EVERYDAY, MADE EASIER</span><div class="hero-brand"><h1 class="hero-title">ARJUNA</h1></div><div class="hero-subtitle">KOST PAKAM</div><p class="hero-caption">Bukan cuma tempat tinggal. <strong>Semua yang kamu butuhkan, ada lebih dekat.</strong><br/> Pilih aja mau ke mana hari ini.</p></div><h2 id="layanan" class="intro-label">PILIH LAYANAN YANG KAMU BUTUHKAN</h2><div class="services-grid">${services.map((s,i)=>`<a class="service-card ${s.id==='kost'?'service-card--primary':''}" href="#${s.path}" aria-label="Buka ${esc(s.name)}"><div class="service-card-media"><img src="assets/${s.image}" alt="Ilustrasi ${esc(s.name)}" ${i>1?'loading="lazy"':''}/><span class="service-card-index">0${i+1}</span><span class="service-card-badge">${icon(s.ico)}</span></div><div class="service-card-body"><h3 class="service-card-name">${esc(s.name)}</h3><p class="service-card-desc">${esc(s.subtitle)}</p><div class="service-card-action"><span>JELAJAHI</span><span class="service-arrow">${icon('arrow')}</span></div></div></a>`).join('')}</div><div class="home-bottom"><i></i><span>SATU TEMPAT. LIMA CARA MEMPERMUDAH HARI.</span><i></i></div><p style="text-align:center;margin:19px 0 0">${badgeNote()}</p></div></section>`}
function section(title,desc='',more=''){return `<div class="section-heading"><div><span class="small-label">ARJUNA KOST PAKAM</span><h2>${title}</h2>${desc?`<p>${desc}</p>`:''}</div>${more}</div>`}
function assurance(kind){const desc=kind==='market'?'Produk salah, rusak atau terlambat? Catat nomor pesanan dan laporkan masalah agar bisa ditelusuri.':kind==='laundry'?'Ada pakaian tertukar, rusak, atau layanan tidak sesuai? Sampaikan masalah melalui tiket dengan detail pesanan.':kind==='restaurant'?'Pesanan keliru, terlambat, atau kualitas makanan bermasalah? Buat laporan agar pengelola dapat menindaklanjuti.':'Keluhan fasilitas kamar, keamanan, atau pelayanan? Setiap laporan perlu penanggung jawab dan status yang dapat dipantau.';const service=kind==='market'?'Toko Arjuna':kind==='restaurant'?'Restaurant Arjuna':kind==='laundry'?'Laundry Arjuna':'Kost Arjuna';return `<section class="assurance" aria-label="Jaminan penanganan keluhan"><div class="assurance-icon">${icon('shield')}</div><div><h3>Ada masalah? Jangan dibiarkan.</h3><p>${desc} Ini rancangan alur Service Assurance, bukan janji SLA operasional yang sudah aktif.</p></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#/bantuan?layanan=${encodeURIComponent(service)}">${icon('message')} Laporkan Masalah</a></section>`}
function catalogue(kind){const data=products[kind];const cat=state.filter[kind];const q=state.search[kind].toLowerCase().trim();const filtered=data.filter(p=>(cat==='Semua'||p.category===cat)&&(!q||`${p.name} ${p.desc}`.toLowerCase().includes(q)));return `<div id="catalogue-grid" class="product-grid">${filtered.length?filtered.map(p=>productCard(p,kind)).join(''):`<div class="empty-panel">${icon('search')}<h3>Belum ketemu, nih.</h3><p>Coba kata kunci atau kategori yang lain.</p></div>`}</div>`}
function productCard(p,kind){const qty=state.cart[kind][p.id]||0;return `<article class="product-card"><div class="product-visual" style="background:${p.tint}"><span class="product-label">${esc(p.category)}</span><span class="product-emoji" aria-hidden="true">${p.emoji}</span></div><div class="product-body"><h3 class="product-title">${esc(p.name)}</h3><p class="product-description">${esc(p.desc)}</p><div class="product-bottom"><span class="product-price">${money(p.price)} <small>/ ${esc(p.unit)}</small></span>${qty?`<div class="qty-control" aria-label="Jumlah ${esc(p.name)}"><button data-action="qty" data-kind="${kind}" data-id="${p.id}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="Kurangi ${esc(p.name)}">${icon('minus')}</button><strong>${qty}</strong><button data-action="qty" data-kind="${kind}" data-id="${p.id}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Tambah ${esc(p.name)}">${icon('plus')}</button></div>`:`<button class="add-button" type="button" data-action="qty" data-kind="${kind}" data-id="${p.id}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Tambahkan ${esc(p.name)} ke keranjang">${icon('plus')}</button>`}</div></div></article>`}
function cartCount(kind){return Object.values(state.cart[kind]).reduce((sum,n)=>sum+Number(n||0),0)}
function cartSubtotal(kind){return products[kind].reduce((sum,p)=>sum+(state.cart[kind][p.id]||0)*p.price,0)}
function marketPage(kind){const isFood=kind==='restaurant';const title=isFood?'Restaurant Arjuna':'Toko Arjuna';const cats=['Semua',...new Set(products[kind].map(p=>p.category))];return `<div class="container inner-page">${crumbs(title)}${hero({title:isFood?'Lagi lapar?':'Butuh sesuatu?',accent:isFood?'Pilih yang enak.':'Tinggal pilih.',desc:isFood?'Makan yang kamu suka tanpa harus ribet. Pilih menu, cek ringkasan, dan coba alur pemesanan dengan mudah.':'Snack, minuman, dan kebutuhan kamar tersusun rapi dalam satu katalog. Pilih barang dan coba checkout dalam beberapa langkah.',img:isFood?'restaurant.webp':'toko.webp',kicker:isFood?'ARJUNA RESTAURANT':'ARJUNA MARKET',theme:isFood?'page-hero--food':''})}<section class="section-mb" id="katalog">${section(isFood?'Pilih menu favoritmu':'Belanja apa hari ini?',isFood?'Menu dan harga berikut hanya contoh desain, bukan daftar menu aktif.':'Produk dan harga bersifat ilustrasi sampai mitra resmi terhubung.')}<div class="market-toolbar"><div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter kategori">${cats.map(c=>`<button class="chip" type="button" data-action="filter" data-kind="${kind}" data-value="${esc(c)}" aria-pressed="${state.filter[kind]===c}">${esc(c)}</button>`).join('')}</div><label class="search-control">${icon('search')}<span class="visually-hidden">Cari produk</span><input id="product-search" type="search" data-search="${kind}" value="${esc(state.search[kind])}" placeholder="Cari ${isFood?'menu':'produk'}..." autocomplete="off" /></label></div><div class="market-layout"><div>${catalogue(kind)}<div class="floating-cart" role="region" aria-label="Keranjang belanja"><div><span>${cartCount(kind)} item di keranjang</span><strong>${money(cartSubtotal(kind))}</strong></div><button class="btn btn-gold" type="button" data-action="cart-open" data-kind="${kind}">${icon('cart')} Lihat Keranjang</button></div></div><aside class="market-sidebar"><div class="cart-info"><div class="circle-illo">${icon('cart')}</div><h3>Sudah pilih yang kamu mau?</h3><p>Keranjangmu sekarang berisi <strong>${cartCount(kind)} item</strong>. Cek pesanan sebelum mengonfirmasi simulasi.</p><button type="button" class="btn" data-action="cart-open" data-kind="${kind}">${icon('cart')} Keranjang · ${money(cartSubtotal(kind))}</button></div><div class="info-block"><h4>${icon('info')} Info penting</h4><p>Belum ada toko maupun transaksi live. Semua daftar, harga, dan proses checkout di halaman ini adalah contoh interaktif.</p></div></aside></div></section>${assurance(isFood?'restaurant':'market')}</div>`}
function laundryPage(){const plan=laundryPlans.find(p=>p.id===state.laundryPlan);return `<div class="container inner-page">${crumbs('Laundry Arjuna')}${hero({title:'Cucian numpuk?',accent:'Kami bantu.',desc:'Coba pilih paket laundry, tentukan jadwal penjemputan, dan lihat estimasi totalnya. Lebih simpel daripada chat bolak-balik.',img:'laundry.webp',kicker:'LAUNDRY ARJUNA',theme:'page-hero--laundry'})}<section class="section-mb">${section('Pilih layanan laundry','Harga dan estimasi pengerjaan merupakan contoh sampai mitra laundry dikonfirmasi.')}<div class="pricing-grid">${laundryPlans.map(p=>`<button class="pricing-card" data-action="laundry-plan" data-value="${p.id}" aria-pressed="${state.laundryPlan===p.id}"><span class="pricing-card-icon">${icon(p.ico)}</span><strong>${p.name}</strong><p>${p.desc}</p><span class="price">${money(p.price)} <small>/ ${p.unit}</small></span></button>`).join('')}</div></section><section class="split-layout section-mb"><div>${section('Jadwalkan jemput cucian','Lengkapi seperlunya. Form ini hanya menyimpan simulasi di browser.')}<form class="form-card" data-form="laundry"><h3>Detail pemesanan</h3><p class="form-intro">Paket terpilih: <strong id="plan-label">${plan.name}</strong>. Tanggal dan jam nantinya akan bergantung pada ketersediaan mitra.</p><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="laundry-name">Nama pemesan <span class="required">*</span></label><input class="input" id="laundry-name" name="name" maxlength="80" required placeholder="Nama kamu" /></div><div class="field"><label for="laundry-weight">Perkiraan berat (kg) <span class="required">*</span></label><input class="input" type="number" id="laundry-weight" name="weight" min="1" max="30" step="1" value="${state.weight}" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="laundry-building">Gedung <span class="required">*</span></label><select class="select" id="laundry-building" name="building" required><option value="">Pilih gedung</option><option value="A">Gedung A</option><option value="B">Gedung B</option><option value="luar">Non-penghuni / lainnya</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="laundry-room">Nomor kamar (opsional)</label><input class="input" id="laundry-room" name="room" maxlength="20" placeholder="Contoh: A-203" /></div><div class="field"><label for="laundry-date">Tanggal jemput <span class="required">*</span></label><input class="input" type="date" id="laundry-date" name="date" min="${today()}" required /></div><div class="field"><label for="laundry-time">Waktu yang diinginkan <span class="required">*</span></label><select class="select" id="laundry-time" name="time" required><option value="">Pilih waktu</option><option value="08:00–11:00">08.00–11.00</option><option value="11:00–14:00">11.00–14.00</option><option value="14:00–17:00">14.00–17.00</option><option value="17:00–20:00">17.00–20.00</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="laundry-note">Catatan (opsional)</label><textarea class="textarea" name="note" id="laundry-note" maxlength="400" rows="3" placeholder="Misalnya: bahan halus, perlu dipisah..." ></textarea></div></div><div class="form-foot"><div class="price-summary"><span>Estimasi ${plan.name}<br/>${money(plan.price)}/kg × <span id="weight-display">${state.weight}</span> kg</span><strong id="laundry-price">${money(plan.price*state.weight)}</strong></div><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%">${icon('calendar')} Simpan Pemesanan Demo</button><p class="disclaimer">Belum mengirim ke kurir atau mitra laundry. Berat aktual, biaya tambahan, dan slot penjemputan harus dikonfirmasi saat sistem live.</p></div></form></div><aside><div class="card card-padded"><span class="small-label">HOW IT WORKS</span><h3 style="font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 20px">Cuci tanpa drama.</h3><div class="process-row" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:11px"><div class="process-step" style="min-height:0"><span class="step-number">01</span><h4>Pilih & jadwalkan</h4><p>Kamu menentukan paket dan waktu yang diinginkan.</p></div><div class="process-step" style="min-height:0"><span class="step-number">02</span><h4>Mitra memproses</h4><p>Setelah dikonfirmasi, cucian masuk ke proses pengerjaan.</p></div><div class="process-step" style="min-height:0"><span class="step-number">03</span><h4>Terima & cek hasil</h4><p>Hasil perlu dicek agar masalah bisa langsung ditangani.</p></div></div></div><div class="info-block"><h4>${icon('shield')} Tanggung jawab layanan</h4><p>Setiap pesanan live akan memiliki nomor referensi, mitra penanggung jawab, progres, dan jalur pengaduan.</p></div></aside></section>${assurance('laundry')}</div>`}
function buildingArt(letter){return `<svg class="building-svg" viewBox="0 0 160 170" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 52 78 24l55 28v90H24z" fill="#f9f7ec" stroke="#2b755b" stroke-width="3"/><path d="m24 52 54-28 55 28" stroke="#144b3a" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M17 148h126" stroke="#144b3a" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M36 64h28v23H36zm60 0h28v23H96zM36 97h28v23H36zm60 0h28v23H96z" fill="#b2d5c1" stroke="#316b58" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M70 142v-39h19v39" fill="#c8a56b" stroke="#316b58" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M78 24v-8" stroke="#c9a56c" stroke-width="3"/><text x="81" y="52" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="700" fill="#114736">${letter}</text></svg>`}
function kostPage(){return `<div class="container inner-page">${crumbs('Kost Arjuna')}${hero({title:'Bukan sekadar kamar.',accent:'Ini rumah kedua.',desc:'Dua gedung yang saling berhadapan, satu pengalaman tinggal yang lebih mudah. Temukan informasi hunian dan akses bantuan lewat satu tempat.',img:'kost.webp',kicker:'KOST ARJUNA',theme:'page-hero--kost'})}<section class="section-mb"><div class="stats-row" style="margin:-12px 0 32px"><span><strong>02</strong>Gedung berhadapan</span><span><strong>30</strong>Total kamar dikelola</span><span><strong>2027</strong>Rencana penambahan gedung</span></div>${section('Kenalan dengan gedung kami','Jumlah kamar tiap gedung dan ketersediaan aktual akan diperbarui setelah data operasional dikonfirmasi.')}<div class="buildings-grid"><article class="building-card"><div class="building-art">${buildingArt('A')}</div><div class="building-body"><span class="building-letter">BUILDING A</span><h3>Gedung A</h3><p>Bagian dari kawasan ARJUNA KOST PAKAM. Informasi kamar tersedia melalui pengelola.</p><a class="btn btn-primary btn-small" href="#/bantuan?layanan=Kost%20Arjuna&topik=Tanya%20kamar%20Gedung%20A">Tanya kamar ${icon('arrow')}</a></div></article><article class="building-card"><div class="building-art">${buildingArt('B')}</div><div class="building-body"><span class="building-letter">BUILDING B</span><h3>Gedung B</h3><p>Berhadapan dengan Gedung A, dengan akses ke layanan dan bantuan yang sama.</p><a class="btn btn-primary btn-small" href="#/bantuan?layanan=Kost%20Arjuna&topik=Tanya%20kamar%20Gedung%20B">Tanya kamar ${icon('arrow')}</a></div></article></div><p class="disclaimer">Ilustrasi bangunan dan foto kamar bukan dokumentasi gedung sebenarnya. Fasilitas, tarif, dan ketersediaan dikonfirmasi langsung sebelum booking.</p></section><section class="section-mb">${section('Sudah tinggal di ARJUNA?','Semua urusan penghuni bisa dimulai dari sini.') }<div class="resident-tools"><a href="#/bantuan?layanan=Kost%20Arjuna&topik=Perbaikan%20fasilitas" class="tool-link"><span class="tool-icon">${icon('wrench')}</span><div><h3>Laporkan Kerusakan</h3><p>Ada fasilitas bermasalah? Buat tiket dan simpan nomor laporannya.</p></div></a><a href="#/bantuan?layanan=Kost%20Arjuna&topik=Tanya%20tagihan" class="tool-link"><span class="tool-icon">${icon('receipt')}</span><div><h3>Urus Tagihan</h3><p>Ajukan pertanyaan tentang pembayaran sewa atau kontrak.</p></div></a><a href="#/aktivitas" class="tool-link"><span class="tool-icon">${icon('clock')}</span><div><h3>Aktivitas Saya</h3><p>Periksa pesanan dan laporan simulasi yang dibuat di perangkat ini.</p></div></a></div></section>${assurance('kost')}</div>`}
function supportPage(){const q=query();const service=q.get('layanan')||'';const topic=q.get('topik')||'';const order=q.get('pesanan')||'';return `<div class="container inner-page">${crumbs('Customer Service')}${hero({title:'Ada yang perlu dibantu?',accent:'Cerita aja.',desc:'Pertanyaan kamar, pesanan, atau kendala pelayanan bisa dicatat melalui satu pintu. Semua masalah seharusnya punya penanggung jawab dan jalur penyelesaian yang jelas.',img:'support.webp',kicker:'ARJUNA CARE CENTER',theme:'page-hero--support'})}<section class="support-layout"><div>${section('Buat laporan atau pertanyaan','Jelaskan masalah dengan singkat. Status laporan dapat dilihat pada Aktivitas Demo.')}<form class="form-card" data-form="ticket"><h3>Bagaimana kami bisa bantu?</h3><p class="form-intro">Isi detail di bawah. Form ini hanya menyimpan contoh tiket di browser, belum dikirim ke admin.</p><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="ticket-name">Nama <span class="required">*</span></label><input class="input" id="ticket-name" name="name" maxlength="80" required placeholder="Nama kamu" /></div><div class="field"><label for="ticket-service">Layanan terkait <span class="required">*</span></label><select class="select" name="service" id="ticket-service" required><option value="">Pilih layanan</option>${services.map(s=>`<option value="${esc(s.name)}" ${s.name===service?'selected':''}>${esc(s.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="ticket-building">Lokasi / gedung</label><select class="select" name="building" id="ticket-building"><option value="">Tidak terkait gedung</option><option value="A">Gedung A</option><option value="B">Gedung B</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="ticket-room">Nomor kamar / pesanan</label><input class="input" name="room" id="ticket-room" maxlength="60" placeholder="Contoh A-101 / AR-..." value="${esc(order)}" /></div><div class="field full"><label>Tingkat kepentingan</label><div class="priority-select"><label><input type="radio" name="priority" value="Normal" checked/><span>${icon('checkCircle')} Normal</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="priority" value="Mendesak"/><span>${icon('alert')} Mendesak</span></label></div></div><div class="field full"><label for="ticket-details">Jelaskan kebutuhan atau masalah <span class="required">*</span></label><textarea class="textarea" name="details" id="ticket-details" minlength="10" maxlength="1200" required placeholder="Jelaskan apa yang terjadi, kapan, dan bantuan yang kamu butuhkan...">${esc(topic?(topic+(order?` — pesanan ${order}`:'')):'' )}</textarea><span class="help-text">Minimal 10 karakter, maksimal 1.200 karakter.</span></div></div><div class="form-foot"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%">${icon('message')} Simpan Laporan Demo</button><p class="disclaimer">Jika situasi membahayakan keselamatan, jangan tunggu tiket online. Segera hubungi layanan darurat setempat atau petugas di lokasi.</p></div></form></div><aside>${section('Pertanyaan umum','Jawaban singkat sebelum menghubungi kami.')}<div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item"><summary>Cara mengetahui kamar yang tersedia</summary><p>Pilih menu Kost Arjuna dan gunakan tombol Tanya Kamar. Informasi ketersediaan sebenarnya harus dikonfirmasi petugas pengelola.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Bagaimana jika pesanan salah?</summary><p>Simpan referensi pesanan, pilih layanan terkait pada formulir bantuan, dan ceritakan masalahnya. Saat sistem sudah aktif, admin dapat menugaskan mitra untuk penyelesaian.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Apakah bisa pesan tanpa penghuni kost?</summary><p>Model layanan untuk pelanggan sekitar masih tahap perencanaan. Ketentuan dan area pengantaran baru akan ditentukan setelah kerja sama mitra selesai.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Apakah website ini sudah menerima pembayaran?</summary><p>Belum. Seluruh checkout, tiket, dan pemesanan di versi ini hanya simulasi lokal. Jangan mengirim uang berdasarkan tampilan demo.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Siapa yang bertanggung jawab jika bermasalah?</summary><p>Rancangan ARJUNA Service Assurance menempatkan pengelola sebagai koordinator pengaduan, sementara mitra terkait bertanggung jawab sesuai kesepakatan layanan dan fakta kasus.</p></details></div><div class="contact-promise"><h4>${icon('shield')} ARJUNA Service Assurance</h4><p>Satu jalur laporan. Nomor referensi yang jelas. Setiap tiket akan diarahkan ke penanggung jawab ketika backend dan operasional resmi telah diaktifkan.</p></div><div class="info-block"><h4>${icon('info')} Kontak resmi</h4><p>Nomor WhatsApp, alamat lengkap dan jam operasional belum dipasang karena belum diberikan. Nanti akan tampil di sini setelah diverifikasi.</p></div></aside></section></div>`}
function activityPage(){const orders=load('orders',[]);const tickets=load('tickets',[]);const filtered=orders.filter(o=>state.activityTab==='all'||o.kind===state.activityTab);return `<div class="container inner-page">${crumbs('Aktivitas Saya')}<div style="margin-bottom:31px"><span class="eyebrow">${icon('clock')} YOUR ACTIVITY</span><h1 style="font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,65px);letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:1.1;margin:12px 0">Jejak aktivitas<span style="color:var(--gold)">.</span></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;max-width:640px">Pantau simulasi pesanan dan tiket yang tersimpan di browser ini. Data tidak terkirim ke admin ARJUNA atau tersinkron antardevice.</p></div><section class="section-mb">${section('Pesanan Saya',`${orders.length} pesanan demo tercatat di perangkat ini.`)}<div class="tabs">${[['all','Semua'],['toko','Toko'],['restaurant','Restaurant'],['laundry','Laundry']].map(([value,label])=>`<button class="chip" data-action="activity-tab" data-value="${value}" aria-pressed="${state.activityTab===value}">${label}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="record-list">${filtered.length?filtered.map(o=>orderCard(o)).join(''):`<div class="empty-panel">${icon('package')}<h3>Belum ada pesanan demo.</h3><p>Mulai dari Toko, Restaurant, atau Laundry Arjuna.</p><a href="#/" class="btn btn-outline btn-small" style="margin-top:16px">Lihat Layanan</a></div>`}</div></section><section>${section('Laporan Saya',`${tickets.length} laporan demo tercatat.`)}<div class="record-list">${tickets.length?tickets.map(ticketCard).join(''):`<div class="empty-panel">${icon('message')}<h3>Belum ada laporan.</h3><p>Kalau ada kebutuhan, kamu bisa mencoba buat laporan.</p><a href="#/bantuan" class="btn btn-outline btn-small" style="margin-top:16px">Buat Laporan Demo</a></div>`}</div></section></div>`}
function orderCard(o,admin=false){const category=o.kind==='laundry'?'Laundry Arjuna':o.kind==='restaurant'?'Restaurant Arjuna':'Toko Arjuna';return `<article class="record"><div><div class="record-sub"><span class="small-label">${esc(o.id)}</span>${statusPill(o.status)}</div><h4 style="margin-top:11px">${category}</h4><p>${esc(o.summary)} · ${money(o.total)}${o.building?` · Gedung ${esc(o.building)}`:''}</p><p>${new Date(o.created).toLocaleString('id-ID',{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'})} · Hanya tersimpan lokal</p></div>${admin?`<div class="admin-actions"><select class="select" data-status-order="${esc(o.id)}" aria-label="Ubah status demo ${esc(o.id)}">${['Demo tersimpan','Diproses','Selesai'].map(s=>`<option ${s===o.status?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`:`<a class="btn btn-outline btn-small" href="#/bantuan?layanan=${encodeURIComponent(category)}&pesanan=${encodeURIComponent(o.id)}">${icon('message')} Bantuan</a>`}</article>`}
function ticketCard(t,admin=false){return `<article class="record"><div><div class="record-sub"><span class="small-label">${esc(t.id)}</span>${statusPill(t.status)}</div><h4 style="margin-top:11px">${esc(t.service)} · ${esc(t.priority)}</h4><p>${esc(t.details.slice(0,200))}${t.details.length>200?'…':''}</p><p>${new Date(t.created).toLocaleString('id-ID',{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'})} · ${esc(t.building?`Gedung ${t.building}`:'Umum')}</p></div>${admin?`<div class="admin-actions"><select class="select" data-status-ticket="${esc(t.id)}" aria-label="Ubah status tiket ${esc(t.id)}">${['Demo tersimpan','Diproses','Selesai'].map(s=>`<option ${s===t.status?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`:`<span class="status-pill">${icon('shield')} Tercatat lokal</span>`}</article>`}
function adminDemoPage(){const o=load('orders',[]),t=load('tickets',[]);const total=o.reduce((s,v)=>s+v.total,0);return `<div class="container inner-page">${crumbs('Panel Demo')}<div style="margin:0 0 27px"><span class="eyebrow">${icon('bars')} ARJUNA MANAGEMENT PREVIEW</span><h1 style="font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,59px);letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:12px 0">Satu pusat kendali<span style="color:var(--gold)">.</span></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:760px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9">Pratinjau operasional dua gedung. Panel ini terbuka hanya sebagai demo, tanpa login dan tanpa database. Jangan gunakan untuk menyimpan informasi penghuni nyata.</p>${badgeNote()}</div><div class="demo-stat-grid"><div class="demo-stat"><small>Total gedung</small><strong>02</strong></div><div class="demo-stat"><small>Total kamar (gabungan)</small><strong>30</strong></div><div class="demo-stat"><small>Pesanan demo</small><strong>${o.length}</strong></div><div class="demo-stat"><small>Laporan demo</small><strong>${t.length}</strong></div></div><section class="admin-section">${section('Pesanan layanan','Perbarui status untuk mencoba sinkronisasi dengan halaman Aktivitas Saya.') }<div class="record-list">${o.length?o.map(x=>orderCard(x,true)).join(''):`<div class="empty-panel">${icon('cart')}<h3>Belum ada transaksi simulasi.</h3><p>Tambahkan produk lewat Toko atau Restaurant, lalu coba checkout.</p></div>`}</div></section><section class="admin-section">${section('Tiket & tanggung jawab','Laporan yang dicatat pengunjung demo di browser yang sama.') }<div class="record-list">${t.length?t.map(x=>ticketCard(x,true)).join(''):`<div class="empty-panel">${icon('message')}<h3>Belum ada tiket simulasi.</h3><p>Coba kirim laporan di halaman Customer Service.</p></div>`}</div></section><section class="card card-padded" style="margin-top:27px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap"><div><h3 style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:16px">Bersihkan data simulasi</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Menghapus pesanan, tiket, dan keranjang yang tersimpan di browser ini saja.</p></div><button class="btn btn-outline" data-action="reset-demo">${icon('trash')} Reset Demo</button></section></div>`}
function unknownPage(){return `<div class="container inner-page" style="text-align:center;padding:100px 0 130px"><span class="eyebrow">404 · NOT FOUND</span><h1 style="font-family:var(--display);font-size:65px;margin:10px 0;color:var(--forest)">Ups, nyasar ya?</h1><p style="color:var(--muted)">Halaman ini belum ada. Yuk, kembali ke ARJUNA.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#/" style="margin-top:16px">${icon('home')} Kembali ke Beranda</a></div>`}
function cartDrawer(kind){const entries=products[kind].filter(p=>(state.cart[kind][p.id]||0)>0);const n=cartCount(kind),subtotal=cartSubtotal(kind);return `<div class="overlay" data-action="close-overlay"><aside class="drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cart-title"><div class="drawer-head"><div><span class="small-label">ARJUNA CHECKOUT</span><h2 id="cart-title">Keranjang Kamu</h2></div><button type="button" class="icon-close" data-action="cart-close" aria-label="Tutup keranjang">${icon('close')}</button></div><div class="drawer-scroll"><p class="small-label">${kind==='restaurant'?'RESTAURANT ARJUNA':'TOKO ARJUNA'} · ${n} ITEM</p>${entries.length?entries.map(p=>`<div class="cart-item"><span class="cart-item-emoji">${p.emoji}</span><div style="flex:1;min-width:0"><strong>${esc(p.name)}</strong><p>${money(p.price)} × ${state.cart[kind][p.id]}</p></div><div class="qty-control"><button type="button" data-action="qty" data-kind="${kind}" data-id="${p.id}" data-delta="-1" aria-label="Kurangi ${esc(p.name)}">${icon('minus')}</button><strong>${state.cart[kind][p.id]}</strong><button type="button" data-action="qty" data-kind="${kind}" data-id="${p.id}" data-delta="1" aria-label="Tambah ${esc(p.name)}">${icon('plus')}</button></div></div>`).join(''):`<div class="empty-panel" style="margin:25px 0">${icon('cart')}<h3>Keranjang kosong</h3><p>Pilih produk yang kamu suka dulu, ya.</p></div>`}${entries.length?`<form id="checkout-form" data-form="checkout" style="margin-top:25px"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="checkout-name">Nama pemesan <span class="required">*</span></label><input class="input" id="checkout-name" name="name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Nama kamu" /></div><div class="field"><label for="checkout-building">Gedung</label><select class="select" id="checkout-building" name="building"><option value="">Bukan penghuni / lain</option><option value="A">Gedung A</option><option value="B">Gedung B</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="checkout-room">Nomor kamar</label><input class="input" id="checkout-room" name="room" maxlength="20" placeholder="Contoh: A-101" /></div><div class="field full"><label for="checkout-delivery">Cara menerima pesanan</label><select class="select" id="checkout-delivery" name="delivery"><option value="pickup">Ambil di toko/mitra · gratis</option><option value="hub">Diantar ke titik serah Arjuna · ongkir demo Rp3.000</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="checkout-note">Catatan (opsional)</label><textarea class="textarea" id="checkout-note" name="note" maxlength="300" rows="2" placeholder="Misalnya: tidak pedas, tanpa es..."></textarea></div></div></form>`:''}</div><div class="drawer-footer"><div class="price-row"><span>Subtotal</span><strong>${money(subtotal)}</strong></div><div class="price-row"><span>Ongkir ilustrasi</span><strong id="delivery-fee">Rp0</strong></div><div class="price-row total"><span>Total estimasi</span><strong id="cart-grand-total">${money(subtotal)}</strong></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" form="checkout-form" ${!n?'disabled':''}>${icon('check')} Konfirmasi Simulasi</button><p class="disclaimer" style="text-align:center">Tidak membuat pesanan atau pembayaran sungguhan.</p></div></aside></div>`}
function dialog(){if(!state.modal)return '';const m=state.modal;return `<div class="overlay modal-overlay" data-action="close-overlay"><div class="modal" role="alertdialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="success-title"><div class="modal-icon">${icon('checkCircle')}</div><span class="small-label">SIMULASI BERHASIL</span><h2 id="success-title">${esc(m.title)}</h2><p>${esc(m.description)}</p><div class="code">${esc(m.id)}</div><button class="btn btn-primary" data-action="modal-activity">${icon('receipt')} Lihat Aktivitas Demo</button><button class="btn btn-text" data-action="modal-close" style="margin-top:12px;width:100%">Tutup</button></div></div>`}
function render({keepScroll=false}={}){
 const y=window.scrollY;
 const p=current();
 document.body.classList.toggle('has-inner',p!=='/');
 const route={'/':home,'/toko':()=>marketPage('toko'),'/restaurant':()=>marketPage('restaurant'),'/laundry':laundryPage,'/kost':kostPage,'/bantuan':supportPage,'/aktivitas':activityPage,'/admin-demo':adminDemoPage}[p]||unknownPage;
 document.title=`${p==='/'?'ARJUNA KOST PAKAM':(services.find(s=>s.path===p)?.name || (p==='/aktivitas'?'Aktivitas Saya':p==='/admin-demo'?'Panel Demo':'Halaman'))+' — ARJUNA KOST PAKAM'}`;
 document.getElementById('app').innerHTML=`${header()}<main id="main-content" class="page-main">${route()}</main>${footer()}${mobileTabs()}${state.drawer?cartDrawer(state.drawer):''}${state.modal?dialog():''}`;
 document.body.classList.toggle('scroll-lock',!!(state.drawer||state.modal));
 if(keepScroll){window.scrollTo({top:y,behavior:'instant'})}
 if(state.drawer||state.modal)requestAnimationFrame(()=>document.querySelector('.icon-close,.modal .btn')?.focus({preventScroll:true}));
}
function toast(message){let root=document.getElementById('toast-root');root.innerHTML=`<div class="toast" role="status">${icon('checkCircle')}${esc(message)}</div>`;clearTimeout(toast.timeout);toast.timeout=setTimeout(()=>{root.innerHTML=''},2800)}
function cartQty(kind,id,delta){if(!products[kind]?.some(p=>p.id===id))return;state.cart[kind][id]=Math.min(99,Math.max(0,(state.cart[kind][id]||0)+delta));if(!state.cart[kind][id])delete state.cart[kind][id];setCart();render({keepScroll:true});}
function trackId(prefix){return `AR-${prefix}-${Date.now().toString(36).toUpperCase().slice(-6)}${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,4).toUpperCase()}`}
function saveOrder(data){const records=load('orders',[]);records.unshift(data);save('orders',records);state.drawer=null;state.modal={title:'Tersimpan di browser!',description:'Ini hanya uji coba alur. Pesanan tidak terkirim ke toko/mitra, dan belum ada pembayaran.',id:data.id};render({keepScroll:true})}
function toNumber(value){const num=Number(value);return Number.isFinite(num)?num:0}
function handleForm(form){if(!form.reportValidity())return;const type=form.dataset.form;const fd=new FormData(form);const fields=Object.fromEntries(fd.entries());const created=new Date().toISOString();if(type==='checkout'){
 const kind=state.drawer;if(!['toko','restaurant'].includes(kind)||!cartCount(kind))return;
 const goods=products[kind].filter(p=>(state.cart[kind][p.id]||0)>0).map(p=>({id:p.id,name:p.name,qty:state.cart[kind][p.id],price:p.price}));
 const total=cartSubtotal(kind)+(fields.delivery==='hub'?3000:0);
 const record={id:trackId(kind==='toko'?'TK':'RS'),kind,created,total,items:goods,summary:goods.slice(0,2).map(x=>`${x.name} ×${x.qty}`).join(', ')+(goods.length>2?` +${goods.length-2} lainnya`:''),name:fields.name.trim(),building:fields.building||'',room:(fields.room||'').trim(),delivery:fields.delivery,notes:(fields.note||'').trim(),status:'Demo tersimpan'};
 state.cart[kind]={};setCart();saveOrder(record);
 }else if(type==='laundry'){
 const weight=toNumber(fields.weight);if(weight<1||weight>30)return;
 const plan=laundryPlans.find(p=>p.id===state.laundryPlan),total=plan.price*weight;
 const record={id:trackId('LD'),kind:'laundry',created,total,summary:`${plan.name} · ${weight} kg · ${fields.date} ${fields.time}`,name:fields.name.trim(),building:fields.building||'',room:(fields.room||'').trim(),date:fields.date,time:fields.time,notes:(fields.note||'').trim(),status:'Demo tersimpan'};
 state.modal={title:'Jadwal demo tersimpan!',description:'Permintaan laundry disimpan secara lokal. Mitra laundry belum menerima jadwal penjemputan ini.',id:record.id};const all=load('orders',[]);all.unshift(record);save('orders',all);render({keepScroll:true});
 }else if(type==='ticket'){
 const details=fields.details.trim();if(details.length<10)return;
 const record={id:trackId('CS'),created,service:fields.service,name:fields.name.trim(),building:fields.building||'',room:(fields.room||'').trim(),priority:fields.priority,details,status:'Demo tersimpan'};
 const all=load('tickets',[]);all.unshift(record);save('tickets',all);state.modal={title:'Laporan demo dicatat!',description:'Tiket hanya tersimpan di browser ini. Belum ada petugas ARJUNA yang menerima atau memproses laporan.',id:record.id};render({keepScroll:true});
 }
}
function updateLaundryEstimate(){const el=document.getElementById('laundry-weight');if(!el)return;const weight=Math.max(1,Math.min(30,toNumber(el.value)||1));state.weight=weight;const price=laundryPlans.find(p=>p.id===state.laundryPlan).price;const total=document.getElementById('laundry-price');const display=document.getElementById('weight-display');if(total)total.textContent=money(price*weight);if(display)display.textContent=weight;}
function updateDeliveryEstimate(){if(!state.drawer)return;const select=document.getElementById('checkout-delivery');if(!select)return;const fee=select.value==='hub'?3000:0;const feeEl=document.getElementById('delivery-fee');const total=document.getElementById('cart-grand-total');if(feeEl)feeEl.textContent=money(fee);if(total)total.textContent=money(cartSubtotal(state.drawer)+fee)}
function handleActions(){
 document.addEventListener('click',e=>{
  const btn=e.target.closest('[data-action]');if(!btn)return;
  const action=btn.dataset.action;
  if(action==='close-overlay'&&e.target!==btn)return;
  if(['close-overlay','cart-close','modal-close'].includes(action)){state.drawer=null;state.modal=null;render({keepScroll:true});return}
  if(action==='mobile-menu'){state.mobileMenu=!state.mobileMenu;render({keepScroll:true});return}
  if(action==='filter'){state.filter[btn.dataset.kind]=btn.dataset.value;render({keepScroll:true});return}
  if(action==='qty'){cartQty(btn.dataset.kind,btn.dataset.id,Number(btn.dataset.delta));return}
  if(action==='cart-open'){state.drawer=btn.dataset.kind;render({keepScroll:true});return}
  if(action==='laundry-plan'){state.laundryPlan=btn.dataset.value;render({keepScroll:true});return}
  if(action==='activity-tab'){state.activityTab=btn.dataset.value;render({keepScroll:true});return}
  if(action==='modal-activity'){state.modal=null;location.hash='#/aktivitas';return}
  if(action==='reset-demo'){if(window.confirm('Hapus semua data demo di browser ini?')){['orders','tickets','cart'].forEach(k=>{try{localStorage.removeItem('arjuna_v2_'+k)}catch{}});state.cart={toko:{},restaurant:{}};render({keepScroll:true});toast('Data demo berhasil dibersihkan.')}return}
 });
 document.addEventListener('submit',e=>{const form=e.target.closest('form[data-form]');if(!form)return;e.preventDefault();handleForm(form)});
 document.addEventListener('input',e=>{
  if(e.target.id==='laundry-weight')updateLaundryEstimate();
  if(e.target.matches('input[data-search]')){
   const kind=e.target.dataset.search;state.search[kind]=e.target.value;
   const target=document.getElementById('catalogue-grid');if(target){const el=document.createElement('div');el.innerHTML=catalogue(kind);target.replaceWith(el.firstElementChild)}
  }
 });
 document.addEventListener('change',e=>{
  if(e.target.id==='checkout-delivery')updateDeliveryEstimate();
  const orderId=e.target.dataset.statusOrder,ticketId=e.target.dataset.statusTicket;
  if(orderId||ticketId){const key=orderId?'orders':'tickets';const records=load(key,[]);const match=records.find(r=>r.id===(orderId||ticketId));if(match){match.status=e.target.value;save(key,records);render({keepScroll:true});toast('Status demo berhasil diperbarui.')}}
 });
 document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{
  if(e.key==='Escape'&&(state.drawer||state.modal||state.mobileMenu)){state.drawer=null;state.modal=null;state.mobileMenu=false;render({keepScroll:true})}
 });
 window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{state.drawer=null;state.modal=null;state.mobileMenu=false;render();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'})});
}
handleActions();render();
